   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Q1. A real thing built from the class, with its own values.\nQ2. So the only way to change them is through methods that can check the input.\nQ3. When it comes from a fixed list, like order status or payment mode.\nQ4. One copy shared by the whole class, not one per object.",
   "originalText": "Q1. A real thing built from the class, with its own values.\nQ2. So the only way to change them is through methods that can check the input.\nQ3. When it comes from a fixed list, like order status or payment mode.\nQ4. One copy shared by the whole class, not one per object.",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
