   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Wallet payments, then Pay Later\n• UPI needs a UPI id, card needs a card number\n• Refunds for UPI and card, but never for cash\n• The same receipt format for every payment",
   "originalText": "• Wallet payments, then Pay Later\n• UPI needs a UPI id, card needs a card number\n• Refunds for UPI and card, but never for cash\n• The same receipt format for every payment",
