   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The same accelerator\nworks in a petrol car\nand an electric car.\nDifferent machinery\nunderneath.\n\nIn code: one method\ncall, many behaviours.\n\nCheckout: pay() does the\nright thing, no if-else.",
   "originalText": "The same accelerator\nworks in a petrol car\nand an electric car.\nDifferent machinery\nunderneath.\n\nIn code: one method\ncall, many behaviours.\n\nCheckout: pay() does the\nright thing, no if-else.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
