   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Interviewers spot leaky getters fast. Any class\nthat holds a list, like a parking floor's spots or\na show's seats, needs this fix.",
   "originalText": "Interviewers spot leaky getters fast. Any class\nthat holds a list, like a parking floor's spots or\na show's seats, needs this fix.",
