   "text": "order.addItem(dosa);     // Rs 120\norder.addItem(paneer);   // Rs 250\n\nList<MenuItem> items = order.getItems();\nitems.clear();\n\nSystem.out.println(order.getTotalAmount());",
   "originalText": "order.addItem(dosa);     // Rs 120\norder.addItem(paneer);   // Rs 250\n\nList<MenuItem> items = order.getItems();\nitems.clear();\n\nSystem.out.println(order.getTotalAmount());",
