   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• super(...) calls the parent's constructor\n• It must be the first line in the child's\n   constructor\n• Leave it out and Java adds super() for you. That\n   fails if the parent has no empty constructor.\n• super.pay() calls the parent's version of a\n   method",
   "originalText": "• super(...) calls the parent's constructor\n• It must be the first line in the child's\n   constructor\n• Leave it out and Java adds super() for you. That\n   fails if the parent has no empty constructor.\n• super.pay() calls the parent's version of a\n   method",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
