   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prints 'Payment ready' and then 'UPI ready'. We never wrote super(), so Java added it\nas the first line of UpiPayment's constructor. The parent part is built before the\nchild part, like the ground floor before the first floor.",
   "originalText": "Prints 'Payment ready' and then 'UPI ready'. We never wrote super(), so Java added it\nas the first line of UpiPayment's constructor. The parent part is built before the\nchild part, like the ground floor before the first floor.",
