   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "final method: children can't override it. We make\ngetReceipt() final so every receipt looks the\nsame. final class: nobody can extend it. String is\nfinal.",
   "originalText": "final method: children can't override it. We make\ngetReceipt() final so every receipt looks the\nsame. final class: nobody can extend it. String is\nfinal.",
