   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Prints 'Generic payment'. Look closely: getDetail is missing an s. Java treats it as\na brand new method, so nothing was overridden. With @Override on top, the compiler\nwould have caught it straight away. Always write @Override.",
   "originalText": "Prints 'Generic payment'. Look closely: getDetail is missing an s. Java treats it as\na brand new method, so nothing was overridden. With @Override on top, the compiler\nwould have caught it straight away. Always write @Override.",
