   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Can an abstract class have a constructor, if we\n    can never call new on it?\n2. What happens if CashOnDelivery forgets to write\n    pay()?",
   "originalText": "1. Can an abstract class have a constructor, if we\n    can never call new on it?\n2. What happens if CashOnDelivery forgets to write\n    pay()?",
