   "text": "• Interface methods are public and abstract by\n   default\n• A class extends ONE class but can implement MANY\n   interfaces\n• Why one parent? Two parents with the same method\n   would clash (the diamond problem)",
   "originalText": "• Interface methods are public and abstract by\n   default\n• A class extends ONE class but can implement MANY\n   interfaces\n• Why one parent? Two parents with the same method\n   would clash (the diamond problem)",
