   "text": "                Abstract class    Interface\nAnswers         what it IS        what it CAN DO\nFields          any               constants only\nConstructors    yes               no\nMethod bodies   yes               default methods only\nPer class       extend only one   implement many\nKeyword         extends           implements",
   "originalText": "                Abstract class    Interface\nAnswers         what it IS        what it CAN DO\nFields          any               constants only\nConstructors    yes               no\nMethod bodies   yes               default methods only\nPer class       extend only one   implement many\nKeyword         extends           implements",
