   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "(a) Abstract class: cars and bikes share real state.   (b) Interface: receipts,\ntickets and invoices can all be printed.\n(c) Abstract class: SMS, email and push share the same fields.   (d) Interface:\nJava's own, anything that can be compared.",
   "originalText": "(a) Abstract class: cars and bikes share real state.   (b) Interface: receipts,\ntickets and invoices can all be printed.\n(c) Abstract class: SMS, email and push share the same fields.   (d) Interface:\nJava's own, anything that can be compared.",
   "fontSize": 28,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
