   "text": "Payment p1 = new UpiPayment(410, \"rahul@okaxis\");\nPayment p2 = new CardPayment(250, \"4111111111114242\");\nPayment p3 = new CashOnDelivery(180);\n\np1.pay();   // UPI version\np2.pay();   // card version\np3.pay();   // cash version",
