   "text": "It compiles, then crashes at runtime with ClassCastException. The compiler only knows\np is some Payment, so the cast might be fine. At runtime Java sees a CardPayment,\nwhich is not a UpiPayment.",
   "originalText": "It compiles, then crashes at runtime with ClassCastException. The compiler only knows\np is some Payment, so the cast might be fine. At runtime Java sees a CardPayment,\nwhich is not a UpiPayment.",
