   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "              Overloading           Overriding\nWhere         same class            parent and child\nParameters    must differ           must be the same\nDecided at    compile time          runtime\nAlso called   static polymorphism   dynamic polymorphism\nExample       two MenuItem          pay() in UpiPayment\n              constructors (L1)",
   "originalText": "              Overloading           Overriding\nWhere         same class            parent and child\nParameters    must differ           must be the same\nDecided at    compile time          runtime\nAlso called   static polymorphism   dynamic polymorphism\nExample       two MenuItem          pay() in UpiPayment\n              constructors (L1)",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 3,
