   "updated": 1700000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Encapsulation: UPI id and card number stay\n   private\n• Abstraction: Checkout only knows Payment and\n   Refundable\n• Inheritance: amount and the receipt live once,\n   in Payment\n• Polymorphism: payment.pay() runs the right\n   version",
   "originalText": "• Encapsulation: UPI id and card number stay\n   private\n• Abstraction: Checkout only knows Payment and\n   Refundable\n• Inheritance: amount and the receipt live once,\n   in Payment\n• Polymorphism: payment.pay() runs the right\n   version",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
