   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Shapes: abstract class Shape with abstract area()\n    and a final describe() that prints the name and\n    area. Add Circle, Rectangle and Triangle. Put\n    them in a List<Shape> and print the total area.\n2. Notifications: fix the Lecture 1\n    NotificationService. Abstract class Notification\n    (recipient, message) with Sms, Email and Push\n    children. An interface Schedulable for the ones\n    that can be sent later (email and push).\n3. Bonus: add WhatsApp without changing any existing\n    class.",
   "originalText": "1. Shapes: abstract class Shape with abstract area()\n    and a final describe() that prints the name and\n    area. Add Circle, Rectangle and Triangle. Put\n    them in a List<Shape> and print the total area.\n2. Notifications: fix the Lecture 1\n    NotificationService. Abstract class Notification\n    (recipient, message) with Sms, Email and Push\n    children. An interface Schedulable for the ones\n    that can be sent later (email and push).\n3. Bonus: add WhatsApp without changing any existing\n    class.",
   "fontSize": 21,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
